<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>Effect of the maximum number of prototypes (<math id="S3.T3.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K_{\max}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K_{\max}</annotation></semantics></math>) on CIFAR-100 under the <math id="S3.T3.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B=10,C=10" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B=10,C=10</annotation></semantics></math> setting.</figcaption>
